<title>USA: Dell to offer U.S. Robotics modem.</title>
<headline>Dell to offer U.S. Robotics modem.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp said Wednesday that Dell Computer Corp will offer U.S. Robotics' x2 high-speed modem technology on Dell Dimension systems early next year.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Dell, a direct marketer of computer systems, will offer the U.S. Robotics Sportster internal modem, with capabilities of downloading information at 56 kilobits per second, in its Dimension products. Dell currently offers the Sportster 33.6 kilobit per second modem.</p>
<p>The Dimension line of personal computers is targeted at small and medium-sized businesses, small offices and home office users, Dell said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
